              "heading": "Cendara University Research Overview"
            },
            "text": "Cendara University is recognized for its dynamic research environment, promoting innovation, collaboration, and societal impact across diverse fields. The university maintains a portfolio of vibrant research centers, robust funding partnerships, prolific faculty scholarship, and a tradition of distinguished achievements."
